font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -24px;\">※접속방법 변경으로 학습관리시스템(LMS)을 통한 접속 불가※</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\nword-break:keep-all\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -24px;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\nword-break:keep-all\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -24px;\">6.&nbsp;</span><font face=\"Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><b>본인 점수 확인방법</b></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\nword-break:keep-all\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 18.6667px; text-indent: -24px;\">&nbsp;1) 학교 포털(Onekit) 접속 → 통합정보시스템 클릭&nbsp; → 학적 클릭&nbsp; → 학적부정보관리(학생) → 제일 뒷쪽 '기초학력평가' 탭 클릭&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\nword-break:keep-all\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 18.6667px; text-indent: -24px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;→ 점수 확인</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\nword-break:keep-all\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -24px;\">&nbsp;2) 학교홈페이지 원킷 로그인 →QUICK MENU 최하단 → '기초학력 증진' 클릭 → 진단평가 결과 확인</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\nword-break:keep-all\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -24px;\">&nbsp; ▶ 기초학력 증진 사이트 첫 접속 시 로그인 정보 확인을 위해 로딩시간(10초 이상)이 다소 소요됨을 양해 바랍니다.</span></p><div style=\"text-indent: -24px;\"><br></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\nword-break:keep-all\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></span></p><br><div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmFYHoQTkgpAYgQQMIFsDKAlT8BGAsgNICGAZgIoCaACgEKL4B0AVgA4DmQA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">프로그램문의&nbsp; ☎054-478-7353</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">시스템오류문의 ☎ 1670-2115</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
